    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d23">

                <pb facs="0146" n="38" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg38"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 277.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 448 of the 2d ultimo, and am gratified to learn of the success of your
                    efforts to obtain the removal of the <hi rendition="#italic">expediente</hi> tax
                    on wheat flour, and an assurance from the Government of Brazil that the tax on
                    all free articles mentioned in the reciprocity arrangement should cease.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
